  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Toshi steps forward and admits he sold the uncensored master tapes to raise Muranishi's bail money, shocking Muranishi into bowing deeply to beg his old friend to halt the sales at once.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おいおい、何が違うんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "意味が全然違いますよ！ダメに決まってるじゃないですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんなこと言ってる場合じゃなかっただろうが！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんの命が懸かってたんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "保釈金を借りてきたってのはウソだったのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "裏ビデオで作った金なのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "俺のせいです。保釈金を全額用意できなかったんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ああそうだよ、きたねえ金だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "でもな、俺がやんなかったらおめえ死んでたんだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "文句あんのか？命の恩人に。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今すぐ販売をやめてくれ。頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "分かったよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おいおい、何が違うんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, come on, what is the big difference?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "意味が全然違いますよ！ダメに決まってるじゃないですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The meaning is completely different! You know we must never betray an actress's consent!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんなこと言ってる場合じゃなかっただろうが！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We were in no position to worry about niceties back then!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんの命が懸かってたんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss's life was hanging on the line!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "保釈金を借りてきたってのはウソだったのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So telling me you borrowed the bail money was a lie?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "裏ビデオで作った金なのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was that money made from underground pirated videos?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "俺のせいです。保釈金を全額用意できなかったんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is my fault, because I couldn't raise the full bail amount in time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ああそうだよ、きたねえ金だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, that's right, it was dirty money.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "でもな、俺がやんなかったらおめえ死んでたんだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, if I hadn't done it, you would have died in prison.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "文句あんのか？命の恩人に。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have a complaint against the man who saved your life?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今すぐ販売をやめてくれ。頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop selling those tapes right now. I am begging you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "分かったよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, fine.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
